WEBVTT

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:07.169
Telo Ride starts here: one Angular workspace, and the ride app it builds.

00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:14.933
The frontend holds three libraries, api, domain and components, and one application,

00:00:14.933 --> 00:00:15.507
ride.

00:00:15.852 --> 00:00:20.284
Ride uses all three. Domain uses api. Api uses nothing.

00:00:20.647 --> 00:00:25.725
Import against that direction and lint fails. And only domain's bluetooth folder may

00:00:25.725 --> 00:00:27.839
touch navigator dot bluetooth.

00:00:30.971 --> 00:00:36.025
Start the app and Home opens in the app shell. The Telo Ride lockup links home, and

00:00:36.025 --> 00:00:39.430
the main navigation marks Home as the current page.

00:00:41.295 --> 00:00:46.598
Every colour is a token from the design system. Barlow Condensed, Inter Tight and

00:00:46.598 --> 00:00:50.237
JetBrains Mono ship with the app, never from a CDN.

00:00:51.618 --> 00:00:56.159
An address that matches no screen says so, with no current item in the header.

00:00:56.504 --> 00:00:58.201
Back to Home opens Home.

00:01:01.942 --> 00:01:06.714
On a keyboard, the first Tab reaches Skip to content, and Enter moves focus straight

00:01:06.714 --> 00:01:07.696
to the page.

00:01:12.266 --> 00:01:17.363
The same shell fits a phone, a tablet, a laptop and a desktop. On a phone, the

00:01:17.363 --> 00:01:19.558
navigation takes its own row.

00:01:22.590 --> 00:01:27.407
Every screen is its own chunk, loaded on demand, and the build fails if the first

00:01:27.407 --> 00:01:29.431
download outgrows its budget.

00:01:32.913 --> 00:01:37.856
What the tests prove: six behaviour specs run against the production build, and any

00:01:37.856 --> 00:01:41.491
page error, or any request off this machine, fails them.

00:01:43.237 --> 00:01:47.840
Telo Ride, from the Telo family, turns a smart bike at home into a game.

00:01:48.185 --> 00:01:52.697
It pairs with the bike over Bluetooth, reads your power and sets resistance for

00:01:52.697 --> 00:01:54.368
every hill and interval.

00:01:54.713 --> 00:01:59.891
Two doors: Race (ride a map against your best-time ghost, bots or people) and

00:01:59.891 --> 00:02:05.339
Classes (ride along to a video, alone or with a group), fed by one progression of

00:02:05.339 --> 00:02:08.329
XP, rider levels, stars and map unlocks.

00:02:08.675 --> 00:02:11.167
A custom workout lives under Profile.
